  "description": "Get ready to elevate your biking experience to new heights with the Biktrix XD Coaxial Drive Motor eBike. This cutting-edge electric bike combines powerful performance with unmatched comfort, offering an exhilarating ride that's perfect for commuters and adventurers alike.\nFeatures:\n\nPowerful 2300W Biktrix XD Coaxial Drive Motor: Experience compact efficiency, balanced handling, and direct power transmission for an unparalleled eBike experience.\n\nPrecise and Powerful Torque: The Coaxial Drive Motor delivers precise and powerful peak torque, ensuring an exhilarating ride with unparalleled performance and responsiveness.\n\nTop Speed of 65 km/h: Soar to new heights with a top speed of 65 km/h, powered by the 2300W motor and 85Nm torque.\n\nRobust 330 lb Load Capacity: Whether commuting or off-road exploring, the robust 330 lb load capacity provides reliability and stability for every journey.\n\nBenefits:\n\nStep-Through Frame: Enjoy easy mounting and dismounting for a comfortable and accessible biking experience.\n\nCadence Sensor: Experience smooth and powerful pedal assistance for effortless riding.\n\nLow-Profile RH Twist Throttle: Intuitive throttle design allows for seamless acceleration and control.\n\nTwo Frame Options: Choose between the agile 16\" medium frame or the extra comfortable 18\" large frame for a personalized ride.\n\nIncludes 52V 17.5Ah 910Wh Removable Internal Battery: Ride with confidence knowing you have ample power for extended adventures.\n\nArmageddon Headlight: Stay safe and well-lit on your journey with a powerful, functional beam.\n\nVersatile Wheelset Options: Choose between stable 26x4 or nimble 27.5x3 wheelsets for a responsive and agile ride.\n\nFront and Rear Fenders: Stay shielded from the elements with practical and stylish fenders.\n\nWide Spring-Supported Comfort Saddle: Enjoy plush support for a comfortable ride, no matter the distance.\n\nThe Biktrix XD Coaxial Drive Motor eBike offers the most powerful eBike motor from Biktrix, combined with a Step-Thru frame for tons of power in an easily accessible frame.",
